    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d948">

                <pb facs="0744" n="662" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg662"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-05-31"><hi rendition="#italic">May 31,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The fort overlooking Managua blew up this afternoon; between 60 and 70 of the
                    garrison killed. Diaz and Mena believe it is part of the Liberal plot, and a
                    number of arrests have been made.</p>
                <p>President Beltrán of Honduras wires Nicaraguan Government that the filibuster <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Eureka</hi> left Salina Cruz May 30 with cargo of arms,
                    ostensibly for Amapala. I have informed legation in Salvador.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Northcott.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
